  description: "Once per turn, if you Normal or Special Summon a \"Gunkan\" monster(s),
    even during the Damage Step: You can place 1 \"Gunkan\" card from your Deck on
    top of your Deck. Once per turn, if a face-up \"Gunkan\" monster(s) you control
    that was Special Summoned from the Extra Deck is sent to your GY by an opponent's
    card: Activate this effect; your opponent pays LP exactly equal to that monster's
    DEF in the GY, then you can apply this effect.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 \"Gunkan
    Suship Shari\" from your hand, then Special Summon 1 \"Gunkan\" Xyz Monster from
    your Extra Deck, by using that card you control as material. (This is treated
    as an Xyz Summon.)"
